  "details": "# Problem\n\nThe location of the photos folder should not be visible right away while just browsing the Camera menu. \n\n# Reasoning\n\nThis path can expose your local PC user name. This is potentially uncomfortable or even risky for people who casually record or stream and don't want to go full Streamer Mode. It can expose your real name or other info.\n\nIt's simply unnecessary for it to be fully visible like this.\n\n# Solution\n\nJust hide it a click away, not have it fully exposed while casually browsing the menus.\n\nE.g. leave the (i) button and make it clickable to open a dialog which presents you the folder path.",
